	(text_box "No RC snubber required, see datasheet for T2035T-8G\nBut for cheap insurance, use a 39Ω/0.01uF RC snubber\n\nAt 60Hz, X_{C2}=~265kΩ. At 120V, I_{C2,RMS}=~0.45mA\n"
